1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,294
[JAO] Our CEO saw your viral confession video.

2
00:00:03,336 --> 00:00:05,422
That was actually one of the deciding factors

3
00:00:05,463 --> 00:00:06,964
on why he said yes to

4
00:00:06,965 --> 00:00:10,468
build a sustainable, mangrove-friendly eco-resort in Cabitoonan.

5
00:00:10,510 --> 00:00:12,511
I almost chose the mangroves over you

6
00:00:12,512 --> 00:00:13,513
[JAO] I know.

7
00:00:13,555 --> 00:00:15,348
But I’m here now.

8
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:17,684
What matters is we're in this together.

9
00:00:17,976 --> 00:00:18,852
Pearl.

10
00:00:18,853 --> 00:00:21,770
Ariel, I got accepted! I got the scholarship!

11
00:00:21,771 --> 00:00:23,188
Wow! Congratulations!

12
00:00:23,189 --> 00:00:24,607
[SIARGAONON] We’re going to celebrate!

13
00:00:24,649 --> 00:00:25,734
[PEARL] Hi, Sir Han!

14
00:00:25,817 --> 00:00:28,820
Thank you for making me feel that my dreams are valid.

15
00:00:28,862 --> 00:00:30,238
But I also hate you.

16
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:32,282
For telling me that you like me

17
00:00:32,866 --> 00:00:35,744
then leave without even asking me if I like you back.

18
00:00:35,785 --> 00:00:37,162
[PEARL] I love you, Sir Han.

19
00:00:37,203 --> 00:00:40,622
And it really hurts that you’re not here because I miss you so much.

20
00:00:40,623 --> 00:00:41,624
[PEARL SOBS]

21
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:42,666
[TANTAN] Sir Handsome!

22
00:00:42,667 --> 00:00:43,877
[JAO] I would like you to meet

23
00:00:43,918 --> 00:00:48,005
the first official hire of Isla Gugma Resort…

24
00:00:48,006 --> 00:00:49,132
Tantan.

25
00:00:49,299 --> 00:00:52,217
[ARIEL] Why won't you let us take you to Manila?

26
00:00:52,218 --> 00:00:53,844
[SIARGAONON] Take care, Princess Pearl.

27
00:00:53,845 --> 00:00:56,556
If you need anything, just text or call, okay?

28
00:00:56,848 --> 00:00:57,849
[HAN BIN] Pearl!

29
00:01:00,018 --> 00:01:01,811
[PEARL] Hey!

30
00:01:06,274 --> 00:01:07,484
When did you get back?

31
00:01:08,777 --> 00:01:09,819
This morning.

32
00:01:10,528 --> 00:01:12,655
I can't miss this for the world.

33
00:01:14,407 --> 00:01:16,326
How's your father?

34
00:01:16,826 --> 00:01:17,994
He has recovered.

35
00:01:18,036 --> 00:01:19,412
And I convinced him that

36
00:01:19,454 --> 00:01:22,040
my sister could take over his business.

37
00:01:23,208 --> 00:01:26,336
But I left my heart here in Siargao.

38
00:01:29,172 --> 00:01:31,883
Sir Han, why aren't you answering your phone calls?

39
00:01:32,008 --> 00:01:34,426
And my text messages?

40
00:01:34,427 --> 00:01:36,054
Did you lose your phone?

41
00:01:40,683 --> 00:01:41,976
[PEARL] But you know what?

42
00:01:44,521 --> 00:01:45,814
Never mind.

43
00:01:47,398 --> 00:01:48,399
‘Cause I’m…

44
00:01:50,610 --> 00:01:51,986
[PEARL] I'm gonna go now.

45
00:01:55,406 --> 00:01:57,533
I got accepted in the scholarship, Sir Han.

46
00:01:57,534 --> 00:01:58,660
I know.

47
00:01:59,828 --> 00:02:01,579
I'm so happy for you.

48
00:02:01,955 --> 00:02:03,623
You're living your dream.

49
00:02:05,291 --> 00:02:06,835
Thank you, Sir Han.

50
00:02:13,174 --> 00:02:14,634
You... You know?

51
00:02:16,135 --> 00:02:17,137
How did…?

52
00:02:18,054 --> 00:02:19,722
You watched the video?

53
00:02:20,223 --> 00:02:21,224
Pearl.

54
00:02:23,935 --> 00:02:24,936
Sir Han.

55
00:02:26,896 --> 00:02:29,107
I know you hate that you love me.

56
00:02:30,608 --> 00:02:31,985
But that's just sad.

57
00:02:32,151 --> 00:02:33,152
Because...

58
00:02:35,488 --> 00:02:37,156
I love that I love you.

59
00:02:40,201 --> 00:02:42,412
[KOREAN] I love you, Pearl.

60
00:02:44,581 --> 00:02:47,542
Sir Han... I love you, too.

61
00:03:02,765 --> 00:03:07,270
[ALON BY JL]

62
00:04:16,965 --> 00:04:17,590
Say hi!

63
00:04:17,591 --> 00:04:18,841
- [ARIEL] Han Bin oppa! - [PA SYSTEM] To our passengers...

64
00:04:18,883 --> 00:04:20,801
- [KARA] Nice to see you! - [PA SYSTEM] this is the boarding announcement ...

65
00:04:20,802 --> 00:04:21,594
- [JAO] Sir Han. - [PA SYSTEM] for flight ...
- [HAN BIN] Jao. - [PA SYSTEM] 2R 925

66
00:04:22,303 --> 00:04:22,845
- [JAO] Good to see you. - [PA SYSTEM] 2R 925

67
00:04:22,846 --> 00:04:24,222
- [ARIEL] When did you arrive? - [PA SYSTEM] to Manila.

68
00:04:24,263 --> 00:04:26,348
- Wait. I think that’s my flight. - [PA SYSTEM] We are now inviting those passengers

69
00:04:26,349 --> 00:04:28,266
- Hug, hug, hug, hug! - [PA SYSTEM] with small children and any...

70
00:04:28,267 --> 00:04:30,727
- [CAROL CRIES] - [PA SYSTEM] passengers requiring special assistance

71
00:04:30,728 --> 00:04:33,231
- [CAROL SNIFFS] - [PA SYSTEM] to begin boarding at this time.

72
00:04:33,648 --> 00:04:34,649
- [PEARL] Okay. - [JAO] Take care, Pearl.

73
00:04:34,983 --> 00:04:36,359
- [PEARL] Bye. - [ARIEL] Take care.

74
00:04:36,401 --> 00:04:38,610
- Mom! Ariel! Kara! - [CAROL] Call every day!

75
00:04:38,611 --> 00:04:40,113
- [JAO] Bye. - [PEARL] Bye!

76
00:04:40,154 --> 00:04:41,864
- [PEARL] Bye! - [PA SYSTEM] Thank you.

77
00:04:42,365 --> 00:04:43,366
[HAN BIN] Pearl!

78
00:04:46,494 --> 00:04:47,787
Before you go,

79
00:04:47,996 --> 00:04:49,580
I have something for you.

80
00:04:50,206 --> 00:04:51,207
Here.

81
00:04:57,046 --> 00:05:00,842
[HAN BIN] It's a little piece of home to remind you of me.

82
00:05:00,883 --> 00:05:04,762
And that you can be confident and that you are never really alone

83
00:05:04,804 --> 00:05:06,389
no matter how far you go.

84
00:05:07,390 --> 00:05:09,808
So, you must remember in Europe,

85
00:05:09,809 --> 00:05:11,226
the food is different.

86
00:05:11,227 --> 00:05:14,230
The sweets, chocolate, they'll be tempting.

87
00:05:15,982 --> 00:05:18,984
So, you’re worried about my cavities?

88
00:05:18,985 --> 00:05:20,027
[HAN BIN CHUCKLES SOFTLY]

89
00:05:20,028 --> 00:05:21,737
I'm worried about your smile.

90
00:05:21,738 --> 00:05:22,572
[PEARL LAUGHS]

91
00:05:22,573 --> 00:05:24,282
So, take care of that smile.

92
00:05:24,323 --> 00:05:25,992
[HAN BIN] It's your best weapon!

93
00:05:26,034 --> 00:05:29,120
Never worry about fitting in. Be confident.

94
00:05:29,162 --> 00:05:32,040
Walk into any room like you own it.

95
00:05:32,749 --> 00:05:33,750
I will.

96
00:05:35,376 --> 00:05:36,461
[KOREAN] Thank you.

97
00:05:45,428 --> 00:05:46,721
[JAO] Nice.

98
00:05:48,973 --> 00:05:51,350
[JAO] So, did the plans get delivered to my office?

99
00:05:51,392 --> 00:05:53,685
- [TANTAN] Yes, sir. - [JAO] I need to review them.

100
00:05:53,686 --> 00:05:55,396
[NOAH] Okay, guys, let's take a picture!

101
00:05:55,938 --> 00:05:56,939
[JAO] Photo?

102
00:05:59,067 --> 00:06:00,068
[JAO] Okay.

103
00:06:00,359 --> 00:06:05,114
[JAO] Did you inform Carol we are having lunch there?

104
00:06:05,156 --> 00:06:07,158
- [TANTAN] Yes, sir. - [JAO] Okay, great.

105
00:06:08,201 --> 00:06:10,411
[JAO] At least we can finally get this started, right?

106
00:06:10,661 --> 00:06:11,662
Right, Noah?

107
00:06:12,246 --> 00:06:13,246
[NOAH] Yes, sir.

108
00:06:13,247 --> 00:06:15,958
We're officially starting the Isla Gugma Eco-Resort.

109
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,294
[JAO] We'll be creating a lot of jobs here.

110
00:06:18,377 --> 00:06:21,881
But at the same time, we're staying true to our core values.

111
00:06:22,048 --> 00:06:24,050
By making sure we don't disturb...

112
00:06:24,092 --> 00:06:27,386
and will continue to protect the mangroves here in Cabitoonan, right?

113
00:06:27,387 --> 00:06:28,387
[NOAH] That's right, sir.

114
00:06:29,889 --> 00:06:30,890
[JAO] Kara?

115
00:06:36,729 --> 00:06:37,854
Surprise visit?

116
00:06:37,855 --> 00:06:38,856
[KARA CHUCKLES]

117
00:06:39,607 --> 00:06:42,610
No, I promised Noah I'd come.

118
00:06:44,237 --> 00:06:45,530
Lucky Noah.

119
00:06:49,158 --> 00:06:51,994
You're so dramatic. Of course I came to see you, too.

120
00:06:54,205 --> 00:06:55,498
[KARA CHUCKLES]

121
00:06:56,124 --> 00:06:58,793
So, Sir Paul is really gone?

122
00:06:59,335 --> 00:07:02,338
Uh... Yes, actually, uh…

123
00:07:02,964 --> 00:07:04,549
he was officially fired last week.

124
00:07:04,841 --> 00:07:09,846
All his unprofessional methods and tactics

125
00:07:10,179 --> 00:07:14,516
and all of the things that could have put the name of the company in jeopardy,

126
00:07:14,517 --> 00:07:15,935
all of those information leaked.

127
00:07:16,060 --> 00:07:17,937
Apparently... [JAO CLICKS TONGUE]

128
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:20,565
an anonymous person snitched.

129
00:07:21,315 --> 00:07:23,234
Anonymous, huh?

130
00:07:23,484 --> 00:07:27,488
Who else knew about his illegal practices?

131
00:07:29,365 --> 00:07:31,242
He had it coming, Kara.

132
00:07:31,450 --> 00:07:35,078
I mean, one of these days, it was bound to happen.

133
00:07:35,079 --> 00:07:36,289
He deserved it.

134
00:07:36,914 --> 00:07:38,499
And it was the right thing to do.

135
00:07:39,500 --> 00:07:41,919
Even though you owed him so much.

136
00:07:42,628 --> 00:07:45,213
But what do you do when someone you owe something to

137
00:07:45,214 --> 00:07:46,424
ends up hurting you?

138
00:07:46,465 --> 00:07:47,966
That person gets cancelled.

139
00:07:47,967 --> 00:07:49,677
He shouldn’t have gone after me, huh?

140
00:07:49,927 --> 00:07:52,846
Well, as long as I'm around, no one can hurt you.

141
00:07:52,847 --> 00:07:55,265
Why don't you just open a security agency?

142
00:07:55,266 --> 00:07:57,685
[JAO CLICKS TONGUE] You're the only one I want to protect.

143
00:07:59,478 --> 00:08:02,481
[KARA AND JAO LAUGH]

144
00:08:06,903 --> 00:08:08,696
[PURE COAST OFFICER ON VIDEO CALL] We share the same advocacies, Caitlyn.

145
00:08:08,738 --> 00:08:10,239
I hope you'll consider the offer, all right?

146
00:08:10,281 --> 00:08:12,074
Thank you so much for the offer.

147
00:08:12,241 --> 00:08:13,951
I'll let you know my decision by Friday.

148
00:08:14,076 --> 00:08:15,285
[PURE COAST OFFICER ON VIDEO CALL] Thank you, Caitlyn.

149
00:08:15,286 --> 00:08:17,705
We're looking forward to working with you here in Denmark,

150
00:08:17,747 --> 00:08:20,917
and wherever Pure Coast has environmental protection programs.

151
00:08:20,958 --> 00:08:22,375
Have a nice day.

152
00:08:22,376 --> 00:08:23,878
You, too. Bye.

153
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,921
[PURE COAST OFFICER ON VIDEO CALL] Bye.

154
00:08:26,088 --> 00:08:27,173
[VIDEO CALL ENDS]

155
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:35,806
[CAROL SNIFFS]

156
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:40,102
[CAROL] You know that...

157
00:08:40,728 --> 00:08:42,730
I support you, right?

158
00:08:43,481 --> 00:08:45,483
Whatever your decision is...

159
00:08:46,442 --> 00:08:48,444
Wherever you may go.

160
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,446
[CAROL SNIFFS]

161
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:55,243
- Oh, Carol. - [CAROL WHIMPERS]

162
00:08:55,576 --> 00:08:59,038
[CAROL CRIES]

163
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:01,749
I don’t know what I’ll do without you.

164
00:09:01,791 --> 00:09:04,209
[CAROL WHIMPERS AND SNIFFS]

165
00:09:04,210 --> 00:09:06,212
[SIARGAONON] You’re my sister.

166
00:09:07,713 --> 00:09:09,130
[SIARGAONON] We’re sisters.

167
00:09:09,131 --> 00:09:10,258
Mhmm.

168
00:09:10,299 --> 00:09:12,885
[CAROL CRIES]

169
00:09:12,927 --> 00:09:14,303
[CAROL EXHALES]

170
00:09:15,429 --> 00:09:16,430
So…

171
00:09:16,472 --> 00:09:17,431
[CAROL CLAPS]

172
00:09:17,473 --> 00:09:18,474
Okay.

173
00:09:18,933 --> 00:09:22,186
In case it’s cold in Denmark,

174
00:09:22,228 --> 00:09:24,729
so let's pick something out.

175
00:09:24,730 --> 00:09:26,232
- Here. - Are we bringing this?

176
00:09:26,274 --> 00:09:27,567
- Yes. - So pink!

177
00:09:27,608 --> 00:09:29,110
- [CAROL LAUGHS] - Look.

178
00:09:30,027 --> 00:09:31,612
From Pacifico…

179
00:09:31,779 --> 00:09:34,114
- to the world! - [CAROL SQUEALS]

180
00:09:34,115 --> 00:09:36,117
- Miss Siargao! - Your turn, come here.

181
00:09:36,158 --> 00:09:37,951
[CAROL] You can also wear it this way, right?

182
00:09:37,952 --> 00:09:39,286
Makes you go “wow!”

183
00:09:39,287 --> 00:09:40,788
- [CAROL] Now, it’s a shirt. - [KARA] I don’t think so.

184
00:09:40,830 --> 00:09:42,831
- [CAROL LAUGHS] -[KARA] Oh! I don’t think it fits.

185
00:09:42,832 --> 00:09:44,749
- [CAROL] But it does! - [KARA] It does!

186
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:45,584
[KARA AND CAROL LAUGH]

187
00:09:57,722 --> 00:09:58,848
[KARA] Are you happy?

188
00:10:03,144 --> 00:10:04,145
Yes.

189
00:10:06,772 --> 00:10:08,858
Because I’m finally home.

190
00:10:11,193 --> 00:10:13,404
And everything I need is here.

191
00:10:14,238 --> 00:10:15,239
The island.

192
00:10:17,491 --> 00:10:18,492
You.

193
00:10:23,456 --> 00:10:24,457
And that.

194
00:10:24,957 --> 00:10:25,958
That boat.

195
00:10:26,042 --> 00:10:27,625
- Oh, is that your boat? - [JAO] Yeah.

196
00:10:27,626 --> 00:10:29,545
[KARA] I thought that would take a while?

197
00:10:29,587 --> 00:10:31,088
- We rushed it! - Oh...

198
00:10:31,630 --> 00:10:32,631
Okay.

199
00:10:33,049 --> 00:10:35,551
- Well, you know… - [KARA LAUGHS]

200
00:10:37,261 --> 00:10:40,598
I somehow got to fulfill my mom's dream.

201
00:10:41,932 --> 00:10:43,559
And my dad's, too.

202
00:10:45,061 --> 00:10:46,437
And for little Jao...

203
00:10:47,229 --> 00:10:48,898
who only used to dream.

204
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:53,152
I’m sure they’re all proud of you.

205
00:10:55,112 --> 00:10:56,906
You’ve come so far,

206
00:10:57,990 --> 00:10:59,658
and you chose to stay.

207
00:11:04,580 --> 00:11:05,581
What about you?

208
00:11:06,415 --> 00:11:07,541
Are you happy?

209
00:11:12,296 --> 00:11:14,298
[WAVES CRASHING]

210
00:11:17,218 --> 00:11:18,219
Kara?

211
00:11:19,887 --> 00:11:23,808
[WAVES CRASHING]

212
00:11:26,268 --> 00:11:28,270
Jao, I'm leaving Siargao.

213
00:11:32,733 --> 00:11:33,734
For…

214
00:11:34,151 --> 00:11:35,361
for vacation?

215
00:11:43,661 --> 00:11:45,579
Kara, you're leaving the island?

216
00:11:51,293 --> 00:11:52,795
[KARA EXHALES]

217
00:11:52,837 --> 00:11:55,840
[KARA BREATHES DEEPLY]

218
00:11:56,590 --> 00:11:58,133
This is hard enough for me.

219
00:11:58,134 --> 00:11:59,593
Please don't make it harder.

220
00:11:59,635 --> 00:12:01,220
Then make me understand.

221
00:12:04,014 --> 00:12:05,015
[JAO] Why?

222
00:12:08,436 --> 00:12:09,562
[KARA EXHALES]

223
00:12:11,147 --> 00:12:13,649
I always say I'll go with the flow.

224
00:12:15,317 --> 00:12:16,735
I'll ride the waves.

225
00:12:21,532 --> 00:12:22,825
But this time...

226
00:12:25,286 --> 00:12:27,705
I'll decide where the flow takes me.

227
00:12:37,715 --> 00:12:40,843
Don't you see a future here in Siargao with me?

228
00:12:42,052 --> 00:12:43,053
[KARA SIGHS]

229
00:12:45,389 --> 00:12:47,516
I thought we loved each other?

230
00:12:47,641 --> 00:12:49,435
And that's true, Jao.

231
00:12:51,061 --> 00:12:53,647
- Don't ever doubt that. - Then don't leave!

232
00:12:57,526 --> 00:12:59,736
If you want to grow, then let's grow together.

233
00:12:59,737 --> 00:13:00,946
Side by side.

234
00:13:04,992 --> 00:13:06,410
Please, Kara. Don't.

235
00:13:07,328 --> 00:13:08,329
Not now.

236
00:13:11,165 --> 00:13:13,667
I'm starting to get to know you more and to love you.

237
00:13:19,089 --> 00:13:20,758
So am I, Jao.

238
00:13:24,929 --> 00:13:27,598
I'm only just getting to know myself, too.

239
00:13:31,727 --> 00:13:33,354
When I moved here,

240
00:13:35,731 --> 00:13:39,109
I decided that I wanted to spend the rest of my life here.

241
00:13:43,572 --> 00:13:45,950
But then I realized this was only the beginning.

242
00:13:50,204 --> 00:13:51,914
[KARA] The island has healed me.

243
00:13:53,707 --> 00:13:54,917
And so did you.

244
00:13:57,169 --> 00:14:00,047
In ways that you will never understand.

245
00:14:01,799 --> 00:14:03,801
You taught me how to breathe again.

246
00:14:04,468 --> 00:14:05,886
To live again.

247
00:14:10,599 --> 00:14:13,101
But as time passes, the more I realize

248
00:14:13,102 --> 00:14:16,021
that there's still something I need to do for myself.

249
00:14:20,359 --> 00:14:22,069
Forgiving...

250
00:14:22,361 --> 00:14:25,281
was only the first part of healing myself.

251
00:14:30,661 --> 00:14:33,163
It wasn't enough for the pain to simply go away.

252
00:14:37,334 --> 00:14:39,044
Because the hardest part...

253
00:14:39,753 --> 00:14:40,754
[KARA SNIFFS]

254
00:14:40,963 --> 00:14:44,133
is figuring out who you are after all that pain.

255
00:14:51,724 --> 00:14:54,810
I won't figure that out if I don't leave the island.

256
00:15:03,110 --> 00:15:04,903
But it's not because you weren't enough.

257
00:15:04,945 --> 00:15:06,947
It's not because I don't love you.

258
00:15:09,742 --> 00:15:12,077
It's because, for the first time in my life,

259
00:15:14,538 --> 00:15:17,124
I'm choosing to know myself completely.

260
00:15:29,511 --> 00:15:30,512
[KARA SNIFFS]

261
00:15:31,138 --> 00:15:32,806
Will this make you happy?

262
00:15:43,275 --> 00:15:44,485
Just know that…

263
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:48,530
if you ever decide to come back,

264
00:15:52,326 --> 00:15:53,911
I’ll be here. [JAO SNIFFS]

265
00:15:57,164 --> 00:16:00,125
Just find me where you left me.

266
00:16:26,819 --> 00:16:27,903
[JAO] Just like before…

267
00:16:27,945 --> 00:16:29,530
We’ll just go with the flow.

268
00:16:29,988 --> 00:16:31,657
And let the wave take us.

269
00:16:31,699 --> 00:16:33,908
[WOMAN] Did you get hit by the Siargao curse, too?

270
00:16:33,909 --> 00:16:35,536
[KARA] It wasn't a curse.

271
00:16:35,661 --> 00:16:37,079
It was a blessing.

272
00:16:38,914 --> 00:16:40,290
[JAO] I love you, Kara.

273
00:16:40,332 --> 00:16:42,126
[KARA] I love you, too, Jao.

274
00:16:42,167 --> 00:16:44,169
[KARA] Jao, I'm sorry.

275
00:16:44,753 --> 00:16:46,380
[JAO] Love is a curse.

276
00:16:46,964 --> 00:16:50,676
But if you're lucky and you find the right person for you...

277
00:16:51,218 --> 00:16:52,720
here on the island,

278
00:16:53,262 --> 00:16:57,516
the Siargao curse can turn into Siargao magic.

279
00:16:57,725 --> 00:16:59,142
[JAO] Thank you for the inspiration.

280
00:16:59,143 --> 00:17:02,229
Because of it, I finally found where I belong.

281
00:17:02,479 --> 00:17:03,480
[NOAH] Caitlyn!

282
00:17:03,522 --> 00:17:05,399
The two community leaders are on their way here.

283
00:17:05,441 --> 00:17:06,817
They want to personally thank you.

284
00:17:06,859 --> 00:17:08,067
Where are you going?

285
00:17:08,068 --> 00:17:09,069
Siargao.

286
00:17:09,111 --> 00:17:10,404
Have you been?
